icon\";s:12:\"bi-buildings\";s:5:\"title\";s:23:\"Commercial Construction\";s:4:\"text\";s:85:\"Office blocks, showrooms and mixed-use buildings designed around rentable floor area.\";}i:2;a:4:{s:12:\"number_label\";s:2:\"03\";s:4:\"icon\";s:11:\"bi-box-seam\";s:5:\"title\";s:20:\"Turnkey Construction\";s:4:\"text\";s:97:\"One contract covering design, permit, structure, finishing and handover — you receive the keys.\";}i:3;a:4:{s:12:\"number_label\";s:2:\"04\";s:4:\"icon\";s:21:\"bi-file-earmark-ruled\";s:5:\"title\";s:21:\"Construction Contract\";s:4:\"text\";s:82:\"Labour-only or material-and-labour contracts with itemised BOQ and staged billing.\";}}'),(1385,255,'_service_cards',''),(1386,257,'service_cards','a:8:{i:0;a:4:{s:12:\"number_label\";s:10:\"Service 01\";s:4:\"icon\";s:13:\"bi-vector-pen\";s:5:\"title\";s:19:\"House Map / Drawing\";s:4:\"text\";s:118:\"Complete working drawings — plans, elevations, sections and detail drawings ready for the municipality and the site.\";}i:1;a:4:{s:12:\"number_label\";s:10:\"Service 02\";s:4:\"icon\";s:14:\"bi-columns-gap\";s:5:\"title\";s:20:\"Architectural Design\";s:4:\"text\";s:118:\"Layouts planned around light, ventilation and your family\'s daily routine, with 3D views before anything is finalised.\";}i:2;a:4:{s:12:\"number_label\";s:10:\"Service 03\";s:4:\"icon\";s:12:\"bi-diagram-3\";s:5:\"title\";s:17:\"Structural Design\";s:4:\"text\";s:107:\"Earthquake-resistant RCC design with full analysis, reinforcement detailing and a signed structural report.\";}i:3;a:4:{s:12:\"number_label\";s:10:\"Service 04\";s:4:\"icon\";s:13:\"bi-calculator\";s:5:\"title\";s:14:\"Estimate & BOQ\";s:4:\"text\";s:108:\"Item-wise bill of quantities and rate analysis, so you know the real cost before committing to a contractor.\";}i:4;a:4:{s:12:\"number_label\";s:10:\"Service 05\";s:4:\"icon\";s:21:\"bi-file-earmark-check\";s:5:\"title\";s:27:\"Building Permit Consultancy\";s:4:\"text\";s:93:\"Document preparation, submission and follo